error: invalid git revision type
 | 
 | git+https://example/project#revision=v1.0.0?signed
 |                            ~^ expected `branch`
 | 
 = while parsing:
   source url: (git+https://example/…)
   └ git fragment: (#revision=v1.0.0?sig…)
     → invalid git revision type
     → expected `branch`, `commit`, `tag`
